                                <title2_200614642
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1651545824678,1661545829678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-23T17:18:24.850-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    jcr:title="Building on expertise to tackle the toughest cancers"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                    type="h3"
                                    variant="h"/>
                                <text2_1220760296
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1659545835858]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2022-12-18T08:54:52.206-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Our scientific research has led to critical discoveries in the treatment of blood cancer. Now we’re expanding our knowledge to help treat solid tumors, which represent more than 90% of cancers that affect people.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;We leverage our deep understanding of human biology and cutting-edge research technologies to find new ways to improve the lives of people with cancer.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <separator
                                    cq:styleIds="[1662756456518]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2023-08-09T13:53:37.870-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-08-09T13:53:37.870-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                                <title2
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1651545824678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-08-09T14:05:09.337-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    jcr:title="Research interests"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                    type="h4"
                                    variant="h"/>
                                <text2
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1659545835858]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2022-12-18T09:01:04.023-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>We focus on creating targeted medicines that either impede the reproduction of cancer cells or enable their death. We achieve this through immuno-oncology approaches, tumor antigen targeting, and taking advantage of specific tumor dependencies. Our research interests include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Identifying and targeting mechanisms that allow tumor cells to proliferate and survive, including under-explored forms of regulated cell death, such as necroptosis and ferroptosis&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Investigating how to re-energize T cells so that they can retain their fitness and continue to destroy tumor cells&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Advancing the use of Antibody Drug Conjugates (ADCs) to target and deliver potent toxins and targeted agents directly to cancer cells&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Creating new technologies to improve the efficacy of bispecific biologics in treating both solid tumors and blood cancers, enabling the development of therapies with highly targeted potential&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Innovating in the field of targeted protein degradation by designing protein degraders that bind to a protein of interest and trigger its proteasomal degradation&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Developing CAR-T cell therapies that attack cancers with healthy donor immune cells engineered to target and kill tumor cells while being resistant to host immune system rejection&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                            </container4_copy>
                        </par_12>
